{"text":"Like all the people who told me not to open a bookstore, you may be wondering if books are even relevant in this golden age of technology. Think of it this way. Every piece of information coming out of your computer or phone is a single thread. At any given moment, you are holding countless threads which range in quality from vital to worthless. What a novelist does is takes all of those threads and weaves them into a tapestry. Maidens, unicorns, pear trees.","words":[{"text":"Like","start":0.48,"end":0.86},{"text":"all","start":0.86,"end":1.12},{"text":"the","start":1.12,"end":1.28},{"text":"people","start":1.28,"end":1.6},{"text":"who","start":1.6,"end":1.82},{"text":"told","start":1.82,"end":2.12},{"text":"me","start":2.12,"end":2.4},{"text":"not","start":2.4,"end":2.7},{"text":"to","start":2.7,"end":2.92},{"text":"open","start":2.92,"end":3.2},{"text":"a","start":3.2,"end":3.36},{"text":"bookstore","start":3.36,"end":3.76,"punct":","},{"text":"you","start":4.0,"end":4.08},{"text":"may","start":4.08,"end":4.28},{"text":"be","start":4.28,"end":4.5},{"text":"wondering","start":4.5,"end":4.9},{"text":"if","start":4.9,"end":5.28},{"text":"books","start":5.28,"end":5.58},{"text":"are","start":5.58,"end":6.08},{"text":"even","start":6.08,"end":6.46},{"text":"relevant","start":6.46,"end":6.92},{"text":"in","start":6.92,"end":7.3},{"text":"this","start":7.3,"end":7.54},{"text":"golden","start":7.54,"end":7.92},{"text":"age","start":7.92,"end":8.4},{"text":"of","start":8.4,"end":8.68},{"text":"technology","start":8.68,"end":9.28,"punct":"."},{"text":"Think","start":10.74,"end":10.96},{"text":"of","start":10.96,"end":11.1},{"text":"it","start":11.1,"end":11.24},{"text":"this","start":11.24,"end":11.42},{"text":"way","start":11.42,"end":11.8,"punct":"."},{"text":"Every","start":13.02,"end":13.46},{"text":"piece","start":13.46,"end":13.88},{"text":"of","start":13.88,"end":14.12},{"text":"information","start":14.12,"end":14.88},{"text":"coming","start":14.88,"end":15